## Vision is off
You get no screenshot, only the accessibility (device-state) text. Ignore any instruction to assess a screenshot.
- Report only values that literally appear in the device-state text.
- A browser page that shows only its URL and an empty or generic "Web View" node has not exposed its content yet. Wait and re-read the device state; do not report values yet.
- Never infer values from memory, typical results, or other sources.
- If the values still do not appear after waiting, say they could not be read and mark the task as failed.
